REM too_many_notepads.duck [FUNNY] - opens three Notepad windows with messages.
REM Mildly chaotic, totally harmless - just close them. Windows only.
DELAY 800
GUI r
DELAY 500
STRINGLN notepad
DELAY 1400
STRINGLN Window 1 of 3 - hi there!
GUI r
DELAY 500
STRINGLN notepad
DELAY 1400
STRINGLN Window 2 of 3 - still me!
GUI r
DELAY 500
STRINGLN notepad
DELAY 1400
STRINGLN Window 3 of 3 - ok i'll stop now. close us whenever.
